  "description": "IMF (International Monetary Fund) exchange-rate provider for Bodu.Financial. Downloads and parses the IMF Representative Exchange Rates monthly tab-separated report and serves the results as Bodu.Financial.ExchangeRates.ExchangeRate values through IDatedRateProvider and IRateProvider, with an async range API. Rates are USD-anchored daily representative rates (all reported currencies against the US dollar) with per-month caching; direction is auto-normalized. Includes the dependency-injection registration extensions (AddImfExchangeRates) for IServiceCollection and IFinancialServiceBuilder.",
